{
  "name": "InOut AI - 42 Complaint Follow-up",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "contract-note",
      "name": "Input Output Contract",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -720,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Complaint Follow Up\n\nFinds complaints requiring follow-up, checks current status, sends customer follow-up when allowed, escalates overdue manager actions, and saves complaint events.\n\nInput: Optional complaint id, branch id, due date filter, or scheduled follow-up batch parameters.\nOutput: { success: true, processed: number, customerFollowUpSent: boolean, managerEscalated: boolean }\n\nShared Input Contract:\n```json\n{\n  \"correlationId\": \"\",\n  \"messageId\": \"\",\n  \"conversationId\": \"\",\n  \"customerId\": \"\",\n  \"customerPhone\": \"\",\n  \"detectedLanguage\": \"\",\n  \"intent\": \"\",\n  \"payload\": {}\n}\n```\n\nShared Output Contract:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"status\": \"SUCCESS\",\n  \"data\": {},\n  \"error\": null,\n  \"meta\": {\n    \"correlationId\": \"\",\n    \"workflow\": \"\",\n    \"durationMs\": 0\n  }\n}\n```\n\nRequired fields:\n- correlationId\n- workflowExecutionId\n- idempotencyKey when writing\n\nRules:\n- Use liability-safe follow-up wording and do not close complaints automatically.\n- Send one WhatsApp message per recipient only.\n- Use templates outside the 24-hour customer care window when backend policy requires it.\n- Escalate P1/P2 or SLA-missed complaints to the responsible manager."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "workflow-input",
      "name": "Workflow Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -680,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "find-complaints-requiring-follow-up",
      "name": "Find Complaints Requiring Follow-up",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -760,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{($vars.SERVICE_API_BASE_URL || 'MISSING_SERVICE_API_BASE_URL').replace(/\\/$/, '').replace(/\\/api\\/v1$/i, '') + '/api/v1/complaints/follow-up-due?limit=' + encodeURIComponent($json.limit || 25) + '&branchId=' + encodeURIComponent($json.branchId || '')'}}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{'Bearer ' + ($vars.N8N_API_KEY || '')}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-Correlation-Id",
              "value": "={{$json.correlationId || $json.correlation_id}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "={{($json.idempotencyKey || $json.idempotency_key || $json.wamid || $json.correlationId || $json.correlation_id || $execution.id)}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": false,
        "contentType": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{$json}}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          },
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "loop-over-complaints",
      "name": "Loop Over Complaints",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        -500,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "check-current-status",
      "name": "Check Current Status",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -240,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{($vars.SERVICE_API_BASE_URL || 'MISSING_SERVICE_API_BASE_URL').replace(/\\/$/, '').replace(/\\/api\\/v1$/i, '') + '/api/v1/complaints/' + encodeURIComponent($json.complaintId || $json.id || $json.body?.data?.complaintId || 'unknown') + '/status'}}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{'Bearer ' + ($vars.N8N_API_KEY || '')}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-Correlation-Id",
              "value": "={{$json.correlationId || $json.correlation_id}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "={{($json.idempotencyKey || $json.idempotency_key || $json.wamid || $json.correlationId || $json.correlation_id || $execution.id)}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": false,
        "contentType": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{$json}}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          },
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "customer-follow-up-required",
      "name": "Customer Follow-up Required?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        20,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "needs-customer-follow-up",
              "leftValue": "={{Boolean($json.body?.data?.customerFollowUpRequired || $json.customerFollowUpRequired)}}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "prepare-customer-message",
      "name": "Prepare Customer Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        280,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const status = $('Check Current Status').first().json.body?.data || {};\nconst complaint = status.complaint || status;\nconst ar = String(complaint.language || 'ar').startsWith('ar');\nconst message = ar ? `نعتذر عن الإزعاج. بلاغك رقم ${complaint.complaintId || complaint.id || ''} ما زال قيد المتابعة، وسنرسل لك تحديثًا بعد مراجعة المسؤول.` : `Sorry for the inconvenience. Your complaint ${complaint.complaintId || complaint.id || ''} is still being followed up, and we will update you after manager review.`;\nreturn [{ json: { ...complaint, customerPhone: String(complaint.customerPhone || complaint.phone || '').replace(/[^0-9]/g, ''), customerMessage: message, correlationId: $('Workflow Input').first().json.correlationId || $('Workflow Input').first().json.correlation_id || 'corr_' + Date.now() } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "send-whatsapp-message",
      "name": "Send WhatsApp Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        540,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "send",
        "phoneNumberId": "={{$vars.WHATSAPP_PHONE_NUMBER_ID}}",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "={{$json.customerPhone}}",
        "textBody": "={{$json.customerMessage}}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "whatsAppApi": {
          "id": "replace_with_n8n_whatsapp_credential_id",
          "name": "WhatsApp Cloud API account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "manager-escalation-required",
      "name": "Manager Escalation Required?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "manager-escalation",
              "leftValue": "={{Boolean($json.body?.data?.managerEscalationRequired || $json.managerEscalationRequired || [\"P1_CRITICAL\",\"P2_HIGH\"].includes($(\"Check Current Status\").first().json.body?.data?.priority))}}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "notify-manager",
      "name": "Notify Manager",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1060,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": "={{$vars.N8N_WF_NOTIFY_BRANCH_MANAGER_ID}}",
        "options": {
          "waitForSubWorkflow": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "save-complaint-event",
      "name": "Save Complaint Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{($vars.SERVICE_API_BASE_URL || 'MISSING_SERVICE_API_BASE_URL').replace(/\\/$/, '').replace(/\\/api\\/v1$/i, '') + '/api/v1/complaints/' + encodeURIComponent($('Check Current Status').first().json.body?.data?.complaintId || $('Check Current Status').first().json.body?.data?.id || 'unknown') + '/events'}}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "={{'Bearer ' + ($vars.N8N_API_KEY || '')}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            },
            {
              "name": "X-Correlation-Id",
              "value": "={{$json.correlationId || $json.correlation_id}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "={{($json.idempotencyKey || $json.idempotency_key || $json.wamid || $json.correlationId || $json.correlation_id || $execution.id)}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { eventType: 'FOLLOW_UP', customerFollowUpSent: Boolean((($items('Send WhatsApp Message', 0, 0)[0] || {}).json || {}).messages?.[0]?.id), managerEscalated: Boolean((($items('Notify Manager', 0, 0)[0] || {}).json || {}).success), status: $('Check Current Status').first().json.body?.data?.status || 'FOLLOW_UP', correlationId: $('Workflow Input').first().json.correlationId || $('Workflow Input').first().json.correlation_id } }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          },
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "return-summary",
      "name": "Return Summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1580,
        20
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "success",
              "name": "success",
              "type": "boolean",
              "value": "={{$json.statusCode >= 200 && $json.statusCode < 300 && $json.body?.ok !== false}}"
            },
            {
              "id": "processed",
              "name": "processed",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "id": "customerFollowUpSent",
              "name": "customerFollowUpSent",
              "type": "boolean",
              "value": "={{Boolean((($items(\"Send WhatsApp Message\", 0, 0)[0] || {}).json || {}).messages?.[0]?.id)}}"
            },
            {
              "id": "managerEscalated",
              "name": "managerEscalated",
              "type": "boolean",
              "value": "={{Boolean((($items(\"Notify Manager\", 0, 0)[0] || {}).json || {}).success)}}"
            },
            {
              "id": "correlationId",
              "name": "correlationId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{$(\"Workflow Input\").first().json.correlationId || $(\"Workflow Input\").first().json.correlation_id}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {
          "dotNotation": false
        }
      }
    }
  ],
